--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Reina Valera 1909 (RVR1909) — Bible text
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Spanish Bible text bundled with this app is the Reina Valera 1909
revision, which is in the public domain in its country of origin and most
other countries. See https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reina-Valera_bible for
background.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Cross-References — openbible.info / scrollmapper/bible_databases
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The cross-references feature uses data derived from the
"openbible.info Cross-References" dataset, distributed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC-BY 4.0).

The data was obtained via the scrollmapper/bible_databases project on
GitHub: https://github.com/scrollmapper/bible_databases (MIT licensed).

The data is derived from the public-domain "Treasury of Scripture
Knowledge" (1850).

- Original source: https://www.openbible.info/labs/cross-references/
- License: CC-BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)
- Required attribution: openbible.info
- Distribution channel: scrollmapper/bible_databases (MIT)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Flutter and other dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This software is built on the Flutter framework and many other open-source
libraries. See pubspec.yaml for the full list of dependencies and their
respective licenses.
